---
// The "pli" name inside running text: Instrument Serif italic, red, a touch larger than the text around it.
---

<em class="pli">pli</em>

<style>
  .pli {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
